# Commands

```bash
npm run dev          # Start with APP_VARIANT=development
npm start            # Start Expo
npm run ios          # Native iOS build
npm run lint
npm run typecheck

npx drizzle-kit generate
```

Inspect SQLite in a dev client with Shift+M, then `expo-drizzle-studio-plugin`.

iOS is the shipping target. Do not treat web bundle failures as bugs.
